# Dual-platform agents — read the skill first

When creating or editing repo-level agent instructions, skills, or agent definitions:

1. **READ** the `dual-platform-agents` skill (`skills/dual-platform-agents/SKILL.md` in the Dual-Platform Agents plugin) if you have not already read it in this conversation.
2. **Follow it exactly** — canonical content under `AGENTS.md` / `.agents/`; Claude paths are symlinks only.

Skipping step 1 is a failure. Do not create Claude-only copies or omit Cursor paths.
